_refine_special_details
; Carbon and Nitrogen atoms were refined isotropically due to the 
  heavily disordered nature of the cations. The C-C and the C-N
  bond distances and the C-C-N and C-C-C bond angles were restrained 
  to 1.500(1) Angstrom and 109.50(1) degrees, respectively. The thermal
  parameters of the EA molecules were restrained so that each cation
  has the same Uiso.
;
